##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 057, tests/arealight, LightKey_NoLeakAcrossFailedLight (FR-004, SC-010, research R11).
# The control: no light statement.
# One quad fills the frame; the surface al_random_surface draws random() only, so each pixel's colour is a function
# of the surface instance's own key and the sample key. Raytrace hider, one box-filtered sample per pixel, no jitter:
# two renders agree byte for byte unless the surface took another instance key.
version 3.03
Hider "raytrace" "jitter" [0]
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
Display "leak-control.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 4 4 1
Projection "orthographic"
Clipping 0.1 100
WorldBegin
  Surface "al_random_surface"
  Polygon "P" [-2 -2 1  2 -2 1  2 2 1  -2 2 1]
WorldEnd
